WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Right-click a PDF. Choose Open with, then Choose another app.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Select Simple Office Tools and choose Always.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Double-click another PDF to open it in the app.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.330
Check the imported PDFs in Arrange.
